  "story": [
    "Gabel is the wheel Breitspur 02 wears: five solid spokes, a flat face and a deep lip, drawn for the R129 SL.",
    "The center is machined from a forged 7075-T6 blank and bolts to a spun lip and barrel from behind, so the hardware is hidden and the face stays clean from the hub to the rim.  The spokes run almost to the edge of the rim, and every window is chamfered front and back so the wheel reads light from any angle.",
    "The lug face is set into the center, with the lion crest on the cap and the name cut into one spoke.  Choose the center color and a polished or color matched lip.  Every set is machined to the fitment of the car it goes on."
  ],
